<div id="shortcuts-overlay" class="hide">
  <div class="shortcuts-content">
    <h4>Keyboard Shortcuts</h4>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pause/Break</strong> - Toggle auto scroll</li>
      <li><strong>Home</strong> - Focus the input</li>
      <li><strong>Insert</strong> - Send a quick command</li>
      <li><strong>Up Arrow</strong> - Previous command in history</li>
      <li><strong>Down Arrow</strong> - Next command in history</li>
      <li><strong>Ctrl+R</strong> - Search command history</li>
      <li><strong>Ctrl/Cmd+F</strong> - Find in all retained output</li>
      <li><strong>F3 / Shift+F3</strong> - Next / previous output match while Find is open</li>
      <li><strong>Arrow keys on the split divider</strong> - Resize output windows</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
